WEBVTT

00:11.894 --> 00:14.688
I don't think we got anyone
on our tail right now.

00:14.772 --> 00:17.816
Bucciarati, isn't it time
we leave Venezia behind?

00:17.900 --> 00:20.360
The Boss has his own
convoy of bodyguards.

00:20.570 --> 00:23.739
Chances are they already know about
our decision to betray.

00:23.906 --> 00:27.784
The next threat… will likely arrive
in the form of one of them.

00:28.828 --> 00:32.957
The worst part is we have no idea
what kind of torture they can inflict on us.

00:33.249 --> 00:36.001
Certo… We'll be sitting ducks
if we take to the seas…

00:36.085 --> 00:38.212
There's no question
it'd be far too risky.

00:38.754 --> 00:40.213
For now, we observe.

00:40.881 --> 00:42.007
Ho capito.

00:42.091 --> 00:43.509
Mista!

00:43.593 --> 00:45.177
- We're hungry!
- I'm starving!

00:45.261 --> 00:47.263
- Give us something to eat!
- I'm starving!

00:49.140 --> 00:52.143
Our gozzos need filling!

00:53.352 --> 00:54.895
Enough guys!

00:56.606 --> 00:58.691
Um, I hate to ask this
right now, guys, but…

00:58.774 --> 01:01.026
could we drop by
a Trattoria or something?

01:02.403 --> 01:03.821
Well, I guess…

01:05.448 --> 01:09.076
Our gozzos could use
some refilling.

01:10.745 --> 01:15.245
<i>You have chosen to rise up against</i>

01:16.417 --> 01:20.917
<i>the fate bestowed to you
by god himself, Gangster…</i>

01:39.732 --> 01:44.153
<i>All our fears were expunged
by our rage</i>

01:44.236 --> 01:48.736
<i>And we vowed to renounce
the devil wearing god's mask</i>

01:51.160 --> 01:53.954
<i>Does retribution mean the end?</i>

01:54.038 --> 01:58.538
<i>We cast away a life that calls
forth the future, so stay gold</i>

02:02.546 --> 02:05.257
<i>That's right, an eye for an eye</i>

02:05.341 --> 02:09.841
<i>And a requiem for a traitor…
Wow</i>

02:13.974 --> 02:18.474
<i>We stand against a world
brought forth by despair</i>

02:19.438 --> 02:22.566
<i>Don't care
We don't need any mercy</i>

02:22.650 --> 02:25.402
<i>When our bodies go to ruin,</i>

02:25.486 --> 02:29.156
<i>will our prayers also vanish?
Hell no</i>

02:29.240 --> 02:33.740
<i>So it begins, our Golden Wind</i>

02:42.670 --> 02:47.170
EPISODE 22
THE "G" IN GOZZO

02:48.300 --> 02:51.720
You know vegetarians, right?
I was thinking…

02:51.804 --> 02:55.682
Is it like, okay for them
to eat cheese and stuff?

02:56.892 --> 02:58.977
Well, I'd say that's a no.

02:59.061 --> 03:02.689
Didja forget milk comes from cows
and eggs come from chickens.

03:02.898 --> 03:06.067
You put milk in a cake,
so that's a no go.

03:06.152 --> 03:08.863
What?! They can't even have cake?

03:08.988 --> 03:12.032
I wonder if all that health crap
really makes any difference.

03:12.241 --> 03:16.203
Then what do they do
about shoes or handbags?

03:16.579 --> 03:18.330
That stuff's all made from leather, right?

03:18.414 --> 03:22.501
Look, they're vegetarians
because they feel bad for the animals.

03:22.752 --> 03:25.671
They can wear sneakers
and carry a freakin' backpack.

03:25.796 --> 03:29.090
Man, they take this stuff totally seriously.

03:29.258 --> 03:31.301
So does that mean there's a bunch
of vegan grannies out there somewhere

03:31.385 --> 03:32.803
looking like basketball players?

03:32.970 --> 03:34.221
- Giorno…
- No restaurant would

03:34.305 --> 03:35.931
- Fear isn't going to do us any favors.
- let them in looking like that.

03:36.015 --> 03:37.558
Try to relax and eat.

03:37.641 --> 03:39.517
Yes, I will try…

03:39.602 --> 03:41.562
We still need to
remain vigilant though.

03:41.687 --> 03:44.940
Someone could very easily poison
the very food we're eating.

03:46.609 --> 03:49.653
Bastardo… What the hell was that?!

03:49.737 --> 03:50.446
Huh?

03:51.030 --> 03:53.198
You think you're gonna get away
with this, you little punk?!

03:53.282 --> 03:56.868
It's gonna cost you…
This suit cost four million lira!

03:57.036 --> 03:58.746
Meet me out front now!

04:03.417 --> 04:05.293
So you're our next foe!

04:05.377 --> 04:06.211
What?!

04:06.462 --> 04:07.838
You an enemy?! Huh?!

04:07.922 --> 04:09.131
You out to get us?!

04:09.465 --> 04:12.509
Cazzone… How do ya like that…
and that?!

04:17.139 --> 04:19.057
Hold it, Narancia, Mista.

04:19.141 --> 04:20.851
I don't think this guy's an enemy.

04:20.935 --> 04:22.686
The bastard's out cold.

04:22.770 --> 04:25.439
You just beat the shit
out of an ordinary guy.

04:25.648 --> 04:27.524
What? Are you for real?

04:27.608 --> 04:29.568
Oh shit, what do I do?

04:29.819 --> 04:32.696
Yeah, this stain isn't going anywhere.

04:33.197 --> 04:36.867
The red wine on the white suit
really isn't helping, is it?

04:36.992 --> 04:39.160
There's no way I can pay for this!

04:39.286 --> 04:41.913
Well, you're lucky the stain
is where it is…

04:41.997 --> 04:43.707
Putting a button there should do the trick.

04:44.917 --> 04:45.959
One more thing…

04:46.043 --> 04:48.837
Let's have him do a little
taste testing to make sure our food is safe.

04:49.505 --> 04:50.964
Oh hell yeah!

04:51.841 --> 04:54.760
Hey, you can cut out
the games right now.

04:55.511 --> 04:57.137
<i>Something's not right…</i>

04:57.221 --> 05:00.015
<i>What's going on with Bucciarati?</i>

05:00.683 --> 05:02.309
<i>There's no question,</i>

05:02.393 --> 05:05.646
<i>his heart was stopped
after his battle with the Boss.</i>

05:06.105 --> 05:10.359
<i>And not a single drop of blood
seeped from his wound</i>

05:11.694 --> 05:13.320
<i>What about now?</i>

05:13.863 --> 05:16.949
<i>This isn't the time to investigate…</i>

05:17.032 --> 05:21.036
<i>It's just a feeling,
but I can't let any of them know right now.</i>

05:22.538 --> 05:26.250
Bucciarati, what do we do
from here on out?

05:27.084 --> 05:30.295
The Boss can obliterate time.

05:30.379 --> 05:33.590
He works in isolation, tearing away
the temporal segment in which he acted.

05:34.174 --> 05:35.550
It's unstoppable.

05:35.634 --> 05:38.762
The person and the approach
don't matter.

05:38.971 --> 05:42.015
No attack has any effect on his Stand.

05:43.559 --> 05:44.601
But…

05:45.561 --> 05:48.355
…all bets are off once we pinpoint
the Boss's true identity!

05:48.439 --> 05:50.858
Once we find out who he really is,

05:50.941 --> 05:53.860
we can off him,
obliterating the user.

05:53.944 --> 05:56.613
We have to reveal
the man behind the mask…

05:57.489 --> 05:59.073
It's our only hope.

05:59.450 --> 06:02.244
That's great, but how the hell
are we gonna find him?

06:02.369 --> 06:06.414
The Boss has made sure to remove
any trace of his life till now.

06:07.041 --> 06:08.292
Trish.

06:08.834 --> 06:11.545
Trish must be able to tell us something.

06:11.629 --> 06:13.297
She's been everybody's target,

06:13.380 --> 06:16.383
not to mention the Boss,
who wanted her dead.

06:19.303 --> 06:20.470
Right?

06:22.348 --> 06:24.975
Well, it's got me thinking…

06:25.142 --> 06:26.143
I say no…

06:26.226 --> 06:28.978
We've involved Trish enough
in all this…

06:29.063 --> 06:31.356
It… It just doesn't feel right.

06:31.440 --> 06:33.066
Trish is the victim here!

06:33.150 --> 06:37.650
Knowing her own father tried to kill her
would be too much for her right now.

06:38.614 --> 06:40.365
Bucciarati, just think about it!

06:40.449 --> 06:43.994
We shouldn't be talking about the Boss
and his secret identity around her!

06:46.413 --> 06:48.998
Thank you,
but it's all right, Narancia.

06:50.167 --> 06:54.667
I know…
I've known for a while.

06:56.173 --> 06:58.175
T-Trish…

06:58.592 --> 07:03.013
I just remembered…
about him leaving no trace.

07:04.181 --> 07:08.681
My mother said she met dad in Sardinia.

07:09.478 --> 07:10.854
Sardinia…

07:11.313 --> 07:12.772
When I was a little girl,

07:12.856 --> 07:16.067
my mother told me a story that
was very strange to me at the time…

07:16.652 --> 07:19.029
They met while she was on vacation.

07:19.113 --> 07:21.782
And one day, he turned to her
and said he would be right back…

07:21.865 --> 07:24.242
She never saw him again.
He left behind nothing…

07:24.326 --> 07:25.785
Not a photo,
not an inkling of his real name.

07:25.869 --> 07:28.413
Before he became
the Boss of the famiglia…

07:28.580 --> 07:29.831
Fifteen years ago…

07:29.915 --> 07:31.416
Could that be where he's really from?

07:32.042 --> 07:34.711
That, I can't say with any certainty…

07:35.713 --> 07:36.797
It's Sardinia…

07:36.880 --> 07:39.883
Sardinia holds the key
to his past and identity.

07:40.217 --> 07:42.010
You know what telling us that will mean.

07:42.094 --> 07:44.763
We very well might end up
killing your biological father!

07:44.847 --> 07:48.058
No, we will do what we must
to defeat him!

07:48.475 --> 07:52.395
Whether you guys decide to defeat him
is your own goddamned business.

07:52.479 --> 07:55.607
There's… There's only one thing
I wanna know!

07:55.691 --> 07:58.068
I want to know whose blood
is coursing through my veins!

07:58.527 --> 08:01.988
I'll be damned if I let one of those bastards
kill me before I know that!

08:05.075 --> 08:06.618
Hey, Narancia.

08:06.702 --> 08:11.202
Looks like she's way tougher
than you had anticipated.

08:12.458 --> 08:13.792
Fine, I get it.

08:14.543 --> 08:16.086
<i>Sardinia…</i>

08:17.880 --> 08:20.966
<i>That's where we're heading
after we escape this place.</i>

08:21.050 --> 08:23.802
<i>That's where we'll find out
who the Boss really is.</i>

08:27.264 --> 08:31.393
I guess I was assuming too much
with Trish…

08:31.477 --> 08:34.480
It's clear she's already
found her determinazione.

08:35.105 --> 08:37.065
My decision to join wasn't
exactly well thought out,

08:37.149 --> 08:38.275
so I shouldn't be surprised.

08:38.358 --> 08:41.444
I have more doubt than hope…
for now.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.086
Huh?

09:33.831 --> 09:35.833
Merda… We've got company!

09:36.708 --> 09:38.918
A shark is swimming
in my soup!

09:39.419 --> 09:40.711
Li'I Bomber!

09:42.631 --> 09:45.216
Giorno! Trish in the turtle, now!

09:45.300 --> 09:47.802
Abbacchio, guard right…
Mista, you secure the left.

09:48.137 --> 09:50.764
Where, Narancia?
Where's the enemy?

09:50.848 --> 09:54.476
Inside the soup…
I don't know how the hell it got in there.

09:54.977 --> 09:56.061
Where did you say?

09:56.145 --> 09:57.688
It… It was there!

09:57.771 --> 10:00.815
I swear there was some
shark-looking thing in my soup!

10:02.151 --> 10:03.735
Sorry, I'm not seeing it.

10:03.819 --> 10:05.987
So then, we lost the thing?

10:17.875 --> 10:19.209
Narancia! What happened?!

10:28.677 --> 10:31.304
Narancia!
Did that weird shark thing get you?

10:31.388 --> 10:32.555
Tell me where it hurts.

10:33.891 --> 10:36.393
Narancia, what's wrong?
What's there?!

10:38.854 --> 10:41.064
Come on,
I asked you a question, Narancia!

10:41.523 --> 10:44.442
Mista, wait.
Narancia may not be able to speak…

10:45.903 --> 10:48.280
What? You can't talk?

10:57.831 --> 11:00.750
What's wrong, Narancia?
What are you pointing at?

11:00.834 --> 11:03.378
Water? You want some water?

11:11.220 --> 11:13.847
H-Hey! We're in trouble! Look!

11:13.931 --> 11:16.600
Narancia's tongue! It's gone!

11:16.683 --> 11:18.976
Forget that,
I don't think he's breathing!

11:20.437 --> 11:21.813
It's worse than I thought.

11:21.897 --> 11:24.649
I can make a replacement
with Golden Wind,

11:24.733 --> 11:26.484
but it'll take some time.

11:26.568 --> 11:30.113
Hey, come on!
He's gonna suffocate to death!

11:30.197 --> 11:31.990
Mista, do you have a pen?

11:32.074 --> 11:35.535
A pen?!
Y-Yeah, I have one…

11:50.300 --> 11:52.176
Thank god, he's breathing.

11:52.719 --> 11:56.472
I'll imbue the pen with life
and create the replacement tissue.

11:57.015 --> 11:59.434
It'll keep him breathing
throughout the replacement process.

12:00.477 --> 12:02.145
It all makes sense now…

12:04.481 --> 12:06.816
That's Giorno Giovanna.

12:09.695 --> 12:11.655
Very interesting.

12:11.738 --> 12:14.574
This explains
the Boss's intelligence reports.

12:14.908 --> 12:19.408
So our greatest threat comes
from this deadbeat newcomer.

12:20.330 --> 12:22.081
I have to admit,

12:22.165 --> 12:24.959
I'm a bit taken aback he managed
to keep Narancia from croaking.

12:25.460 --> 12:29.960
I never thought Crush would have
any trouble with this killing job,

12:30.966 --> 12:35.466
but apparently killing all five of them
requires your involvement…

12:37.347 --> 12:38.681
Tiziano.

12:38.807 --> 12:43.307
We're the Boss's personal bodyguards.
We have to make sure they die here.

12:45.314 --> 12:47.649
Are you ready, Squalo?

12:47.733 --> 12:49.860
You bet your ass I am.

12:50.277 --> 12:54.239
Once I lure them into the water,
Crush will be unstoppable.

12:54.823 --> 12:56.699
Our plan will decide everything.

12:57.117 --> 12:59.619
We off 'em one by one, Tiziano.

12:59.703 --> 13:01.788
Yeah, Squalo…

13:01.872 --> 13:04.040
…and Narancia is gonna help.

13:09.546 --> 13:11.506
SQUALO
CRUSH

13:15.510 --> 13:16.928
You okay, Narancia?

13:17.012 --> 13:18.054
Yeah…

13:19.097 --> 13:20.473
That was close.

13:20.557 --> 13:22.016
What did you see?

13:22.100 --> 13:24.644
Could you tell how their Stand works?

13:24.770 --> 13:28.607
It… c-came from the soup…

13:30.150 --> 13:31.651
Narancia, just try to relax.

13:31.735 --> 13:33.611
I-I'm fine. Talking doesn't hurt.

13:33.695 --> 13:36.572
Hey, Narancia,
what does the enemy look like?

13:36.740 --> 13:38.074
Didja catch where he ran to?

13:38.241 --> 13:39.367
He was…

13:40.160 --> 13:42.078
He was really small like a little pebble!

13:42.162 --> 13:44.581
The guy was huge,
and he ran into the back of the restaurant!

13:45.707 --> 13:48.835
Huh? Huge like a pebble?

13:48.919 --> 13:52.297
But you just said it was in your soup!

13:52.381 --> 13:53.715
You're not making sense.

13:53.799 --> 13:56.802
Huh? Did I just say that?

13:58.136 --> 13:59.679
Fine, I'll just ask…

13:59.763 --> 14:02.223
So would you say
the guy was about this big?

14:02.307 --> 14:03.433
Nuh-uh.

14:03.892 --> 14:05.685
Huh? No, wait!

14:05.769 --> 14:07.771
Then, like, this big?

14:07.854 --> 14:09.480
U-Um…

14:09.564 --> 14:12.316
No? Then, like, this big?

14:12.401 --> 14:13.860
Yeah, that.

14:15.404 --> 14:19.157
So this big ass enemy
was in your bowl,

14:19.241 --> 14:21.785
and then,
he ran off into the restaurant?

14:21.868 --> 14:22.702
Yeah.

14:22.786 --> 14:24.746
Huh? What?

14:24.830 --> 14:28.750
The picture you're painting
isn't quite coming through.

14:29.251 --> 14:32.212
So are you trying to say
he moves at extremely high speeds?

14:32.295 --> 14:34.297
No, he was slow as molasses!

14:34.923 --> 14:35.757
What?

14:35.841 --> 14:36.466
Huh?!

14:37.259 --> 14:40.637
If it was huge and slow,
why didn't we see it?

14:40.846 --> 14:43.348
You sure you saw a Stand?

14:43.432 --> 14:46.560
Of course I… didn't—

14:48.979 --> 14:51.064
You know you're really starting
to sound like a nut job!

14:51.857 --> 14:54.234
- You're not trying to hide the fact
- I…

14:54.317 --> 14:56.986
- that you got beat by the enemy, are you?
- I… I…

14:57.070 --> 15:00.615
Answer me…
You didn't see a thing, did you?

15:00.699 --> 15:02.784
Of course I did…

15:03.952 --> 15:05.662
not…

15:07.998 --> 15:10.709
So you really didn't see anything!

15:10.792 --> 15:12.960
You picked a helluva time
to dick around!

15:13.628 --> 15:15.838
I'm picking up nothing nearby.

15:16.006 --> 15:18.883
Whatever it is,
it must be a long-range Stand.

15:18.967 --> 15:23.137
The user must be observing us
in safety from afar.

15:23.930 --> 15:27.308
I have a feeling we need to begin making
our escape sooner rather than later.

15:27.392 --> 15:29.227
We can escape to sea from the canal.

15:30.812 --> 15:32.647
Great idea, Giorno!

15:32.731 --> 15:35.859
Let's get going…
The canal is waiting!

15:36.651 --> 15:40.029
Yes, Narancia.
That's what I just…

15:40.947 --> 15:41.697
Narancia?

15:41.990 --> 15:46.244
Narancia, why do you keep
covering your mouth?

15:46.328 --> 15:47.746
Uncover your mouth.

15:52.000 --> 15:55.044
What the hell?
Your mouth is totally fine.

15:55.128 --> 15:56.796
Yeah, nothin' wrong here!

15:56.880 --> 16:00.884
Nothing wrong at all, Mista!

16:03.094 --> 16:05.304
So what's the deal, Bucciarati?

16:05.430 --> 16:06.806
We heading out to sea?

16:07.599 --> 16:10.768
No, we won't be heading down
the canal just yet.

16:10.852 --> 16:12.478
This is our chance.

16:12.562 --> 16:15.398
This is the time to hunt down
and destroy our pursuer!

16:16.858 --> 16:21.237
The Boss had no idea
we would betray him.

16:21.321 --> 16:25.821
It's safe to say he has yet to
mobilize his entire unit of bodyguards.

16:27.118 --> 16:29.453
If we can take down
whoever is here now,

16:29.538 --> 16:32.207
we'll be able to escape into
the open sea in much greater safety.

16:32.290 --> 16:35.501
You know, that makes
a whole lot of sense. I'm in.

16:35.585 --> 16:37.461
Yeah, you can count me in too.

16:37.671 --> 16:39.923
All right then, it's settled, Bucciarati.

16:40.048 --> 16:41.507
We'll do what you think is best.

16:43.426 --> 16:47.926
Abbacchio, could you run
a little replay with Moody Jazz?

16:48.848 --> 16:50.307
You got it.

16:50.392 --> 16:52.143
So Boss, where do we start?

16:52.227 --> 16:55.104
While the soup was still on the table?

16:55.522 --> 16:56.689
That should do it.

16:57.482 --> 16:58.941
Dammit, Narancia?

17:03.154 --> 17:05.781
Guys! The enemy's right over there!

17:08.952 --> 17:13.414
Over there? You mean inside
the restaurant's bathroom?

17:16.251 --> 17:19.796
Narancia, you damn well better
have seen something this time!

17:19.921 --> 17:21.589
Yup, I did!

17:22.340 --> 17:25.926
After them. We'll settle things
with this enemy here and now.

17:30.181 --> 17:32.183
Come on, Giorno. Let's go.

17:32.267 --> 17:33.184
Right…

17:40.609 --> 17:43.111
Well, thank you very much, Narancia.

17:43.194 --> 17:46.530
Now your playmates
have no idea that

17:47.115 --> 17:51.615
my aqueous Stand, Crush,
has a wonderful little helper.

17:51.995 --> 17:54.914
Yeah, my Stand, Talking Mouth,
works wonders,

17:54.998 --> 17:58.543
especially when it's latched
onto your tongue and

17:58.627 --> 18:02.047
rewired your brain
to defy your own verbal intentions.

18:04.299 --> 18:08.428
Well, my itch to kill
isn't gonna scratch itself. Grazie.

18:08.887 --> 18:12.432
<i>S-So that's what it was… Cazzo!</i>

18:12.891 --> 18:17.391
<i>They freakin' used me to get
the guys close to the water, one by one.</i>

18:17.479 --> 18:19.355
<i>Nobody mocks me!</i>

18:19.856 --> 18:22.066
I'm not picking up on anything…

18:22.150 --> 18:24.694
Come on, we gotta at least figure out
what this bastard looks like.

18:25.153 --> 18:26.571
Moody Jazz!

18:26.655 --> 18:30.700
Find whoever was just here
and initiate chase mode now!

18:35.288 --> 18:36.289
Narancia!

18:36.623 --> 18:38.750
<i>Yes, find the user with Moody Jazz,</i>

18:38.833 --> 18:40.876
<i>but don't go after him!</i>

18:40.960 --> 18:43.212
<i>If he steps into the water,
he'll be a goner!</i>

18:43.296 --> 18:47.091
<i>I am gonna have to bust my ass
to keep him as far away as possible!</i>

18:54.933 --> 18:56.351
This must be the spot…

18:57.352 --> 18:59.395
Moody Jazz is transforming.

18:59.896 --> 19:03.065
<i>Just step away
Don't look in there!</i>

19:05.694 --> 19:07.153
Hey guys, look over here…

19:07.237 --> 19:10.490
- Take a look inside this thing!
- Shit, you really are a dirty bastard!

19:10.573 --> 19:13.367
Come on, over here, Abbacchio!

19:13.451 --> 19:15.411
Hurry and look inside the bowl!

19:15.704 --> 19:18.957
What the…? Is this some kind of
new fetish or something?

19:19.124 --> 19:23.419
You said you saw the enemy in here,
so we're here investigating!

19:23.586 --> 19:25.504
What the hell did you actually see?

19:25.588 --> 19:27.214
I'm saying I saw—

19:28.091 --> 19:30.218
Dammit, I've had enough.

19:30.301 --> 19:34.096
Bucciarati, Narancia was probably
just seeing things.

19:34.305 --> 19:38.309
If we're really gonna pursue this guy,
we should go back to that table.

19:38.393 --> 19:39.602
I suppose so.

19:39.728 --> 19:41.938
For Christ sake, Narancia!

19:42.147 --> 19:43.398
Any more of this bullshit

19:43.481 --> 19:45.566
and you could end up derailing
everything we've worked for!

19:57.579 --> 20:00.915
Narancia, what happened to your finger?

20:01.040 --> 20:02.916
You must have cut it on something.

20:03.251 --> 20:05.628
Here, let me stop the bleeding for you.

20:06.546 --> 20:09.632
<i>Cazzone, you're gonna try
to move through my blood.</i>

20:10.049 --> 20:13.510
<i>N-No! S-Stay back, Giorno!</i>

20:13.678 --> 20:16.055
Yes, I need your help, Giorno!

20:18.975 --> 20:21.018
Something is definitely going on here.

20:21.102 --> 20:22.978
What's going on inside your mouth?

20:23.229 --> 20:25.064
The enemy did do something
to your tongue.

20:25.148 --> 20:26.399
I wonder if that has
something to do with…

20:27.901 --> 20:30.695
<i>Attaboy, Giorno,
I knew you'd pull through.</i>

20:31.321 --> 20:32.530
<i>You're so close…</i>

20:32.614 --> 20:35.158
<i>You're so close to
figuring this out, Giorno.</i>

20:35.450 --> 20:37.827
You're really bleeding.

20:37.952 --> 20:39.995
First things first, we need to
take care of this wound.

20:40.413 --> 20:41.664
Come on, hands here.

20:45.043 --> 20:47.170
<i>No, please, no, don't touch my blood!</i>

20:47.712 --> 20:48.838
Come on, Narancia.

20:48.922 --> 20:50.798
<i>Merda… Stay back, stay back.</i>

20:50.882 --> 20:51.215
Hurry!

20:51.800 --> 20:53.384
Li'l Bomber!

21:03.353 --> 21:04.187
<i>Damn it…</i>

21:05.814 --> 21:06.689
Narancia…

21:07.607 --> 21:11.652
Something has to be controlling you
to act like this…

21:11.736 --> 21:16.073
There has to be some reason why
you can't give us a straight answer.

21:16.241 --> 21:19.202
<i>Yes! You finally figured it out!</i>

21:19.828 --> 21:24.249
I wonder whether that Stand
left something behind in your mouth?

21:24.332 --> 21:27.418
Something that compels you to say
the opposite of what you really intend…

21:27.502 --> 21:30.505
<i>Yes! That's it, Giorno!</i>

21:38.012 --> 21:41.056
<i>Sh-Shit! There's water from the pipe!</i>

21:51.192 --> 21:54.486
Giorno!

23:38.299 --> 23:42.011
EPISODE 23
CRUSH AND TALKING MOUTH
